      "writtenOn": "2024-10-31T16:18:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shall we leave it be then until 24Q4 goes out?\n\nFWIW, all this change did was centralize our SDP record so the target and controller can update a single record when concurrent source and sink are both enabled, Without it, we had an extra SDP record that was confusing devices.\n\nOn phones, you don\u0027t have concurrent source/sink, so this was more or less a mechanical refactor. It just changed the resting place of the SDP data.",
